## [S9b] Kotlin 파라미터 이름 불일치 — alice(ROLE_USER) 로 호출
byOrderId(orderId="alice") [#id == authentication.name] -> thrown=org.springframework.security.authorization.AuthorizationDeniedException rows=0
negated(orderId="blocked") [#id != 'blocked']           -> thrown=- rows=1
byId(id="alice") [#id == authentication.name]           -> thrown=- rows=1
# exit=0
